<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Happy Valentine's Day Sathakshi</title>

<style>
body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
  background: linear-gradient(to right, #ff5f6d, #ffc371);
  color: white;
  text-align: center;
  overflow-x: hidden;
}

header {
  padding: 50px 20px;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
}

h1 {
  font-size: 3em;
}

.section {
  padding: 40px 20px;
}

.photos {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr);
  gap: 15px;
  padding: 20px;
}

.photos img {
  width: 100%;
  border-radius: 20px;
  border: 4px solid white;
}

.card {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
  border-radius: 20px;
  padding: 30px;
  margin: 20px;
}

footer {
  padding: 20px;
  font-size: 1.2em;
}

.heart {
  color: red;
  font-size: 2em;
  animation: pulse 1s infinite;
}

@keyframes pulse {
  0% {transform: scale(1);}
  50% {transform: scale(1.3);}
  100% {transform: scale(1);}
}

/* Falling hearts */
.falling-heart {
  position: fixed;
  top: -10px;
  color: pink;
  font-size: 20px;
  animation: fall linear infinite;
  pointer-events: none;
}

@keyframes fall {
  to {
    transform: translateY(100vh);
  }
}

/* WhatsApp Button */
.whatsapp-btn {
  background: #25D366;
  color: white;
  padding: 15px 25px;
  border-radius: 30px;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-size: 18px;
  display: inline-block;
  margin-top: 20px;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
<h1>💖 Happy Valentine’s Day Sathakshi 💖</h1>
<p>You are my forever Valentine</p>
</header>

<div class="section card">
<h2>💌 My Message For You</h2>
<p>
My dear Sathakshi, you are the most beautiful part of my life.  
Every moment with you feels magical and special.  
Thank you for being my happiness and my peace.  
I love you today, tomorrow and always ❤️
</p>
</div>

<div class="section">
<h2>📸 Our Memories</h2>
<div class="photos">
<img src="photo1.jpg">
<img src="photo2.jpg">
<img src="photo3.jpg">
<img src="photo4.jpg">
</div>
<p>Replace photo1.jpg, photo2.jpg, photo3.jpg, photo4.jpg with your personal photos</p>
</div>

<div class="section card">
<h2>💕 Reasons I Love You</h2>
<p>
❤️ Your smile<br>
❤️ Your kindness<br>
❤️ Your care<br>
❤️ Your love<br>
❤️ Everything about you
</p>
</div>

<div class="section card">
<h2>🌹 My Promise</h2>
<p>
I promise to always stand by you, respect you and love you forever.  
You are my today and all of my tomorrows.
</p>
</div>

<div class="section">
<a class="whatsapp-btn"
href="https://wa.me/?text=Happy%20Valentine’s%20Day%20My%20Love%20Sathakshi%20💖%20I%20made%20this%20for%20you!"
target="_blank">
💚 Share on WhatsApp
</a>
</div>

<footer>
<p>Forever Yours <span class="heart">♥</span></p>
<p>Happy Valentine’s Day Sathakshi 💝</p>
</footer>

<script>
// Falling hearts generator
setInterval(() => {
  const heart = document.createElement("div");
  heart.classList.add("falling-heart");
  heart.innerHTML = "💖";
  heart.style.left = Math.random() * 100 + "vw";
  heart.style.animationDuration = (Math.random() * 3 + 2) + "s";
  document.body.appendChild(heart);

  setTimeout(() => {
    heart.remove();
  }, 5000);
}, 300);
</script>

</body>
</html>
